{"success":true,"site":"steam","sid":"3825390","name":"BLUE REFLECTION Quartet: 少女们的奇迹","type":"game","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【关于 BLUE REFLECTION】</h2>以少女们细腻情感与深厚情谊为主线的RPG系列，其原点可追溯至《BLUE REFLECTION 幻舞少女之剑》。作品讲述了一名受伤的少女在与他人相遇中收获情谊，凭借魔法少女“反像者”的力量挺身对抗世界威胁的故事。其后系列不仅推出多部游戏作品，还衍生至动画、手机及PC游戏等多个领域。 <br> <br>如今，汇聚所有少女情感的《BLUE REFLECTION》系列四部作品，尽数收录于此！<br>本作搭载了多种便利功能，相较当年原版大幅优化可玩性。即使是首次接触本系列的玩家，也能更轻松地理解世界观。老玩家也能进一步加深对“BLUE REFLECTION”系列的理解。<br>玩家可从菜单界面自由选择心仪的作品进行游玩。<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/35d7ad5e691a62506785a475ee370c52.avif?t=1785376324\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras_big/35d7ad5e691a62506785a475ee370c52.avif?t=1785376324 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【BLUE REFLECTION 幻舞少女之剑】</h2>讲述一名受伤少女在与他人相遇中收获情谊，以魔法少女“反像者”的力量对抗世界威胁的单机游戏作品。  <br>本作是系列第一部作品，由插画师岸田梅尔担纲角色设计与监修，作家时雨泽惠一、五十岚雄策、夏海公司联手构筑系列剧情，将现代学园、少女与幻想元素融于一体，2017年3月正式问世。<br><br>在《BLUE REFLECTION Quartet》中，水波光影、空气质感等世界观的视觉表现焕然一新，角色与场景贴图实现高清重制。同时新增移动加速、自动存档等原版没有的多项功能，带来更加流畅舒适的游戏体验。<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/8a95eaeea57dd11784fb5907a82e082d.poster.avif?t=1785376324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/8a95eaeea57dd11784fb5907a82e082d.webm?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/8a95eaeea57dd11784fb5907a82e082d.mp4?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【BLUE REFLECTION: 澪】</h2>讲述各怀心事的少女们，在摩擦与碰撞中依然选择相信彼此，最终寻得光明的动画故事。  <br>本作以《BLUE REFLECTION 幻舞少女之剑》为原点，是跨媒体企划的重要一环，于2021年4月至9月期间播出。<br><br>在《BLUE REFLECTION Quartet》中，动画剧情经过重新编排，主要角色以3D模型呈现！<br>玩家跟随阳樱莉和瑠夏的脚步，穿梭于名为“可梦”的集体潜意识所构筑的世界，在接触少女们情感的同时，前往可梦最深处寻找紫乃。<br><br>通过收集散落在场景各处的记忆碎片，即可解锁短篇故事，更深入体验“澪”的世界。<br>此外，本作新增了序章与终章，将系列作品之间的关联娓娓道来。<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f67c21c95d63e807a2cfee1fb0fa12be.poster.avif?t=1785376324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f67c21c95d63e807a2cfee1fb0fa12be.webm?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f67c21c95d63e807a2cfee1fb0fa12be.mp4?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/8a121b008135323f1d87beead1c8cf8c.poster.avif?t=1785376324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/8a121b008135323f1d87beead1c8cf8c.webm?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/8a121b008135323f1d87beead1c8cf8c.mp4?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【BLUE REFLECTION: 灿】</h2>讲述在逐步走向终结的世界里，少女们依然相信希望、编织未来的手机/PC游戏。  <br>本作以《BLUE REFLECTION 幻舞少女之剑》为原点，作为跨媒体企划的一环，于2023年2月上线手机及PC平台。<br><br>在《BLUE REFLECTION Quartet》中，“灿”的故事以全新形态在家用机上重现！<br>玩家可以在校园中自由漫步，与少女们交流互动。战斗部分则沿用《BLUE REFLECTION: 帝》的系统，忠实还原“灿”中令人印象深刻的战斗场面！<br>本作还特别收录全新撰写的24话剧情事件，包括原作中未曾出现的角色间互动等内容！<br>此外，本作完整收录了描绘系列作品之间关联的原作序章与终章。<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/4542aa13f771cb6a62463b304fd2b2a0.poster.avif?t=1785376324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/4542aa13f771cb6a62463b304fd2b2a0.webm?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/4542aa13f771cb6a62463b304fd2b2a0.mp4?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/85d0ccd076b5ebdfd410c747f826df13.poster.avif?t=1785376324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/85d0ccd076b5ebdfd410c747f826df13.webm?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/85d0ccd076b5ebdfd410c747f826df13.mp4?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/d2c407b2c01dc691373d20e548560dc0.poster.avif?t=1785376324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/d2c407b2c01dc691373d20e548560dc0.webm?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/d2c407b2c01dc691373d20e548560dc0.mp4?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【BLUE REFLECTION: 帝】 </h2>讲述失去记忆的少女们在直面内心的过程中寻回记忆，逐步逼近世界真相的单机游戏作品。<br><br>本作以《BLUE REFLECTION 幻舞少女之剑》为原点，作为跨媒体企划的一环，于2021年10月发售。<br><br>在《BLUE REFLECTION Quartet》中，《澪》《灿》中的八位少女将作为新角色加入战斗阵容！玩家可以操控这些新角色，体验更多样的战斗乐趣。<br>不仅如此，新增的参战角色以及夕月、来梦还可以在拍照模式中使用！<br>本作还搭载了移动加速、战斗加速、剧情快进等一系列便利功能，带来更加舒适流畅的游戏体验。<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f3d48c8ad4d696b1ae8ceae15db302c3.poster.avif?t=1785376324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f3d48c8ad4d696b1ae8ceae15db302c3.webm?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f3d48c8ad4d696b1ae8ceae15db302c3.mp4?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/df537b9c7eface0ee3fa499f6c5ffc8d.poster.avif?t=1785376324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/df537b9c7eface0ee3fa499f6c5ffc8d.webm?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/df537b9c7eface0ee3fa499f6c5ffc8d.mp4?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f4fb4683376dfaeb1e2411f3c9b68a46.poster.avif?t=1785376324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f4fb4683376dfaeb1e2411f3c9b68a46.webm?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f4fb4683376dfaeb1e2411f3c9b68a46.mp4?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f37e17bd8d93cd16627f96f615d718c7.poster.avif?t=1785376324\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f37e17bd8d93cd16627f96f615d718c7.webm?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/f37e17bd8d93cd16627f96f615d718c7.mp4?t=1785376324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【REFERENCE】</h2>本作搭载了能让玩家更深入了解“BLUE REFLECTION”世界的数据库“REFERENCE”！  <br>世界图谱按时间顺序清晰呈现，还可以查阅系列全作的人物关系图。  <br>玩家能更深入地理解角色的背景故事和系列整体的世界观，进一步感受“BLUE REFLECTION”的魅力！<br><br>此外还新增“GALLERY”功能，可以欣赏岸田梅尔的插画。<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras/604883eebb8d0d4ca8d41a9f1b8193f8.avif?t=1785376324\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/extras_big/604883eebb8d0d4ca8d41a9f1b8193f8.avif?t=1785376324 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >各作品剧情</h2><strong>《BLUE REFLECTION 幻舞少女之剑》</strong><br>因脚伤而被迫放弃芭蕾梦想的少女日菜子，在失落之际遇到两名神秘少女夕月与来梦，并获得了一股神秘的力量。<br>她们告诉日菜子，只要击败企图毁灭世界的威胁“原种”，就能实现一个愿望。<br>为对抗原种，日菜子开始收集人们情感的碎片“意念碎片”，踏上战斗的旅途。<br><br><strong>《BLUE REFLECTION: 澪》 </strong><br>总是乐观向上、无法对需要帮助的人置之不理的平原阳樱莉，与想要亲近他人却不知该如何相处的笨拙少女羽成瑠夏。<br>两位少女的相遇，不仅改变了她们自身的命运，也将改变整个世界——<br><br><strong>《BLUE REFLECTION: 灿》</strong><br>被派往史上最弱部队担任队长的主人公，在迎战从灰烬中诞生的怪物“异灰”的同时，也不得不面对队员们各自背负的烦恼与过去，与不断蔓延的灰之侵蚀抗争。<br><br><strong>《BLUE REFLECTION: 帝》</strong><br>暑假期间因补考来到学校的少女爱央，回过神来时，发现自己身处一所被水包围的校园。<br>在那里，她遇到了一群失去记忆的少女，开始探索这个突然出现的异世界“心像空间”。<br><br>※图片为开发中版本，与实际游戏内容可能存在差异。","header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/3efdbd77bf0f46275ae0c2795216bda865b576a9/header_schinese.jpg?t=1785376324","website":"https://blue-reflection.com/quartet/","developers":["KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD."],"publishers":["KOEI TECMO GAMES CO., LTD."],"release_date":"2026 年 7 月 29 日","coming_soon":false,"price":{"currency":"USD","initial":"49.99","final":"49.99","discount":0},"supported_languages":"英语, 简体中文, 繁体中文, 日语<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>具有完全音频支持的语言","platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":["单人","Steam 成就","完全支持控制器","自定义音量控制","可调整难度","无需应对快速反应事件","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DUALSHOCK 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","DualSense 控制器支持","随时保存","立体声","Steam 云","家庭共享"],"genres":["冒险","休闲","角色扮演"],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>最低配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows® 11<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 or better, AMD Ryzen 3 3200G or better<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (4GB VRAM) or better, AMD Radeon R9 380X (4GB VRAM) or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>网络:</strong> 宽带互联网连接<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 55 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> 16-bit stereo with 48KHz playback<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> The above specs are expected to provide 30 fps gameplay using a resolution of 1280 x 720 with graphics quality set to Lowest and VSync turned on.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>推荐配置:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位处理器和操作系统<br></li><li><strong>操作系统:</strong> Windows® 11<br></li><li><strong>处理器:</strong> Intel Core i7-8700 or better, AMD Ryzen 3 3100 or better<br></li><li><strong>内存:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>显卡:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 (8GB VRAM) or better, AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT (6GB VRAM) or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX 版本:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>网络:</strong> 宽带互联网连接<br></li><li><strong>存储空间:</strong> 需要 55 GB 可用空间<br></li><li><strong>声卡:</strong> 16-bit stereo with 48KHz playback<br></li><li><strong>附注事项:</strong> Use of SSD storage recommended. The above specs are expected to provide 60 fps gameplay using a resolution of 1920 x 1080 with graphics quality set to Standard and VSync turned on.</li></ul>"},"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/ab9d5fea97235c33bf303eda0ec0fb4e4f791dd0/ss_ab9d5fea97235c33bf303eda0ec0fb4e4f791dd0.600x338.jpg?t=1785376324","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/ab9d5fea97235c33bf303eda0ec0fb4e4f791dd0/ss_ab9d5fea97235c33bf303eda0ec0fb4e4f791dd0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785376324"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/98a1efcb94ca32fb8502a19a847f2d839ee29d63/ss_98a1efcb94ca32fb8502a19a847f2d839ee29d63.600x338.jpg?t=1785376324","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/98a1efcb94ca32fb8502a19a847f2d839ee29d63/ss_98a1efcb94ca32fb8502a19a847f2d839ee29d63.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785376324"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/56f614fa1907594b89c2598eff2f1287e5b9e97f/ss_56f614fa1907594b89c2598eff2f1287e5b9e97f.600x338.jpg?t=1785376324","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825390/56f614fa1907594b89c2598eff2f1287e5b9e97f/ss_56f614fa1907594b89c2598eff2f1287e5b9e97f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785376324"}]}